{{ArcaneBox}}
'''Cascadia Overcharge''' is a [[Arcane Enhancement#Secondary_Weapon_Arcanes|Secondary Arcane]] that grants additional [[Critical Chance]] to the secondary weapon while [[Overshields]] are active.
==Effect==
{| class="emodtable"
|-
!Rank !! Critical Chance
|-
| 0 || +50%
|-
| 1 || +100%
|-
| 2 || +150%
|-
| 3 || +200%
|-
| 4 || +250%
|-
| 5 || +300%
|}

==Acquisition==
{{Acquisition|Cascadia Overcharge can be purchased from [[Cavalero]] for {{sc|10,000}}, requiring '''Rank 5 - Angel''' with [[The Holdfasts]]. It can also be dropped by [[Thrax Centurion]], [[Thrax Legatus]], and [[Void Angel]]s on the [[Zariman Ten Zero]].|header=no}}

===Farming Tips===
*Thrax enemies are abundant in [[Mobile Defense]] and [[Void Cascade]] missions.
*The Zariman Arcane drop is considered as a mod drop, and is thus affected by [[The Steel Path]] and [[Mod Drop Chance Booster]].

==Notes==
*'''Cascadia Overcharge''' stacks additively with mods like {{M|Pistol Gambit}} and {{M|Creeping Bullseye}}. For example, a {{Weapon|Lex Prime}} with a max rank {{M|Pistol Gambit}} and '''Cascadia Overcharge''' would have a {{Math|25% {{mul}} (1 + 120% + 300%)|mt = y|p = y}} critical chance on attacks.
*The bonus to critical chance only applies to the secondary or exalted weapon on which it is equipped, not to other weapons or Warframe abilities.

==Tips==
*{{M|Shield Charger}} can be used to gain overshields.
*The [[:Category:Augur Mods|Augur Mods]] set bonus can consistently generate Overshields for many Warframes as long as they use energy ''and'' have shields.
*Warframes with abilities that generate Overshields can efficiently make use of this Arcane, such as {{WF|Harrow}}'s {{A|Condemn}}, {{WF|Hildryn}}'s {{A|Pillage}}, and {{WF|Protea}}'s long-press {{A|Grenade Fan}}. Condemn and Pillage can also be used by any Warframe via the [[Helminth]].
*Warframes with abilities that can prevent their shields from taking damage, such as {{WF|Dante}}, {{WF|Revenant}}, and {{WF|Rhino}}, can keep this Arcane's benefits active potentially indefinitely. Revenant in particular, while {{A|Mesmer Skin}} is active, has functional invincibility to enemy damage and {{D|Magnetic}} status effects and can sometimes generate shields for himself with {{A|Reave}}, but can still take damage from environmental hazards.
*Certain [[Warframe Augment Mods]] can be used to generate overshields or [[Overguard]] to protect any overshields you may have, such as {{WF|Volt}}'s {{M|Capacitance}}, {{WF|Trinity}}'s {{M|Vampire Leech}}, or {{WF|Frost}}'s {{M|Icy Avalanche}}.

